        '0.0': 'Standing in the middle of that palace, Hanuman, eager to see Sita, went through the bowers of creepers, the picture-halls and the night-chambers, but he did not see her of lovely form.',
        '0.1': 'Not seeing Rama\'s beloved, the great monkey thought: "Surely Sita is no longer alive, since Maithili does not come into my sight however I search."',
        '0.2': '"That noble Janaki, intent on guarding her virtue and firm on the path of the noble, must surely have been killed by this chief of rakshasas, doer of evil deeds."',
